            "review_title": "Review at Apoketherapy",
            "review_text": "Andrea Lee\n1 contribution\n0\nOne of the best Poke restaurant ever.\nJul 2019 • Solo\nI have tried a lot of Poke restaurants around the world and I must say that Apoketherapy is hands down the best place I have been too. \n\nThe service was quite slow when I was there (came during a busy period) but the owner was very courteous so I did not make a big deal out of it.\n\nFood was amazing and I even went to the restaurant more than three times during my 1 week trip. Definitely worth the wait and looking forward to visit the place again soon.\n\nRecommendations - tried their signature bowls but would rec you to create your own as you can put all the stuffs that you like and eat it the way you love your salad, but don’t forget to ask for the spicy mayo sauce - it is the best!\nRead more\nWritten December 6, 2019\nApoketherapy\nThank you so much for your kind words and support! \n\nWe appreciate your feedback and we sincerely apologise for the delayed service you had experienced. We will try our best to continuously improve our service quality!\n\nYour review really matters to us and our team is happy to know that despite the small hiccups u were still satisfied with our products. We look forward to serving you again in the future :)\nRead more\nWritten December 19, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
